// `trades-terminal-view` — without that class every `.tp-*` rule misses. It used
// to inject its own unscoped copy (`TP_TERM_CSS`), which phase 2 deleted; see
// docs/PLAN-2026-08-17-mobile-responsive-ui.md §5.1.
